    "closure": "rank three reduces to a weighted C4-free incidence graph with two exact plane-genus budgets",
    "statement": "Every official tensor-rank-three Shape-A survivor gives two birational rational plane coefficient curves of degrees m=e-2 and n=(3e-7)/2. Grouping the 3e parameter branches and R=3n+7 domain branches by equal coefficient image produces a weighted C4-free bipartite graph. Every domain vertex has parameter-weighted degree m; every parameter vertex has domain-weighted degree n-w_P; and sum_P s_P w_P=2e-7. Plane delta-genus gives sum_P binom(s_P,2)<=binom(m-1,2) and sum_Q binom(l_Q,2)<=binom(n-1,2). Hence both sides have at least ten image vertices, every domain vertex has at least two neighbours, and at least e+7 parameter branch weight occupies at least two zero-deficit vertices, each with at least two neighbours.",
